Lunchtime
Chef has his lunch only between 1pm to 4 pm.Given that the current time is 
𝑋pm find out whether it is lunchtime for Chef.

input
3
1
7
3

output
YES
NO
YES

===
t=int(input())
for i in range(t):
    x=int(input())
    if x==1 or x==2 or x==3 or x==4:
        print("YES")
    else:
        print("NO")
